# ---- Generated tokenizer inputs ----
# Corpus inputs are regenerated from data/train.tsv by notebooks/tokenizer.ipynb.
# The trained tokenizer itself (artifacts/tokenizer/ur_sp.model / .vocab) IS committed:
# retraining SentencePiece reshuffles token IDs and silently invalidates checkpoints.
